F209 — a leading `::` on a qualified name is not consumed

parseQualifiedName stopped at the global-scope qualifier, so `::QPI::Something` did not parse.
Consumes a leading `::` when an identifier follows it.

Measured: GlobalScope both backends `1 0 1`. Suite 1085/0.

